// Back assassination, one point of the sweep over distance (220 uu behind an unaware guard, both
// facing -x). Rule (melee.md F4, ported): DisItemContext_Assassinate takes an NPC within its reach
// (m_fMaxContextRange 275, m_fRayScalePercent 1.25 of the speed factor; no speed bonus standing), on any side
// (m_fAllowedAngleFromTargetDir 360; the side picks the Front / Left / Right / Back move set, 0x00BBA970), when
// m_AssassinateOnAwareness allows its EAIAwareness (Unaware, Surprised, Suspicious, Begging; 0x00C09060) and it
// is not running (0x00C090D0). The dummy is an idle guard with a brain and no faction (Unaware): a Passive
// pawn has no AI and the port treats it as aware. The expected value follows the decoded rule (UNMEASURED).
(
    name: "combat/melee_assassinate_back_d220",
    system: Combat,
    map: "Playground",
    description: "Swing at an unaware guard 220 uu ahead of the player, both facing the same way.",
    setup: (
        player: Some((position: (-5300, 0, 96), yaw: 180, pitch: 0)),
        npcs: [(id: Some("dummy"), position: Some((-5520, 0, 92)), yaw: 180, state: Some("Idle"), faction: Some("None"))],
        settle: 30,
    ),
    ticks: 180,
    input: [(tick: 5, action: Press(Primary))],
    checkpoints: [
        (name: "assassinated", expect: [(metric: Count("Sim:Death@dummy[cause=Assassination]"), value: 1, tol: 0, source: "assassinate reach 275 (DisTweaks_Assassinate, 0x00C0D8F0); before the port: 165 (0.6 x 275)", status: Unmeasured)]),
    ],
    record: [Pawn, Npc("dummy"), SimEvents],
    capture: Some("lab npcs; place the player 220 uu behind an unaware guard (idle, not passive); press attack; record the context chosen (DisItemContext_Assassinate vs MeleeAttackPlayer) and the target's awareness value"),
)